  "solution": {
    "text": "Pulling force is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math>, while mass in motion is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>'</mo></msup></math>. So acceleration of the system will be given by<br />​<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mspace width=\"0.5em\"/><mspace width=\"0.5em\"/><mspace width=\"0.5em\"/><mspace width=\"0.5em\"/><mspace width=\"0.5em\"/><mspace width=\"0.5em\"/><mtext>a</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mtext>m</mtext><mo>'</mo></msup><mtext>g</mtext></mrow><mfenced><mrow><mtext>m</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>M</mtext><mo>+</mo><msup><mtext>m</mtext><mo>'</mo></msup></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mspace width=\"0.5em\"/><mspace width=\"0.5em\"/><mspace width=\"0.5em\"/><mspace width=\"0.5em\"/><mspace width=\"0.5em\"/><mspace width=\"0.5em\"/><mspace width=\"0.5em\"/><mtext>....(i)</mtext></math><br /><br />Mass&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> will not slide over <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math> if&nbsp;<br /><br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; a cos&theta; = g sin&theta;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ....(ii)<br /><br />&nbsp;From equation (i) in (ii), we get<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mfrac> <mrow> <msup> <mtext>m</mtext> <mo>&#8242;</mo> </msup> <mtext>g cos &#952;</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>m</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mtext>M</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <msup> <mtext>m</mtext> <mo>&#8242;</mo> </msup> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>=</mo> <mtext>g sin</mtext> <mtext>&#952;</mtext> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mtext>or</mtext> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <msup> <mtext>m</mtext> <mo>&#8242;</mo> </msup> <mo>=</mo> <mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>m</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mtext>M</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mtext>cot &#952;</mtext> <mo>-</mo> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </math>"
